<title>USA: USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</title>
<headline>USA-STOCKS-OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Industrials were flat at the opening on Friday, with the market neither continuing its downward trend nor seeing much in the way of bargain hunting.</p>
<p>The Dow was steady at 6,927, while the Nasdaq Composite was off fractionally at 1,347 and the S&amp;P Index down fractionally at 803.</p>
<p>The 30-year long bond was up 8/32 to yield 6.63 percent.</p>
</text>
